                        "difficultyIds": "11797937e327eb6d913faa80427c566b",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Analyzing 分析",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nCharacteristic symptoms of right colon tumors include vague, dull abdominal pain exacerbated by walking and dark red– or mahogany-colored blood mixed in the stool. The symptoms described in the other options are associated with left colon tumors.",
